@dc:description "A vocabulary bundle for the method ontologies"
vocabulary bundle <http://www.example.com/method/bundle#> as v-bundle {
    includes <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/> as dc
    includes <http://www.example.com/method/access-profile#>
    includes <http://www.example.com/method/entitlement#>
    includes <http://www.example.com/method/role#>
    includes <http://www.example.com/method/account#>
    includes <http://www.example.com/method/identity#>
    includes <http://www.example.com/method/application-source#>
}
